  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakama munyichima yenuku. Mwamukuhwelelaŋa Nzambi, nkuhwelelenu ninami nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitala daTata yami mwakushakama mwekala mwamuvulu; neyi himwadiŋi chochochuku nadi kuyileja. Nukuya nakuyiloŋeshela mwakushakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineli nami nukuya nakuyiloŋeshela mwakushakama, ami aweni nakenza cheŋi nakuyitambula; kulonda kunakekalami, diku mwakekali ninenu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njila yakunukuyami mwayiluka dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomasi hakumwila nindi, Mwanta, hitweluka kuwukuyaku; indi njila tukuyiluka ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwila nindi, Ami yami njila, yami walala, yami wumi. Kwosi muntu niwumu wukwinza kudi Tata chiŋa hadami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwaŋilukili, mutenowu mwadi kwiluka niTata yami nawa; kufumisha kulelu munamwiluki, munamumoni dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fwilipu hakumwila nindi, Mwanta, tuleji Tata; dimu tunakeŋi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwila nindi, Eyi Fwilipu, munashakami nenu mwejimimu, wubuli kuŋiluka? Muntu nanmonami namoni Tata. Wunelilidi neyi, Tuleji Tata? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinekalami mudi Tata, niTata mudami, eyi kwitiyamu nehi? Awa mazu nayilejaŋa, himazu akumuchima wamami awenuku, Tata washakama mudami diyi wudi nakukalakala nyidimu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋitiyenu nenu nekala mudi Tata niTata wekala mudami; hela neyi omu nehi, ŋitiyilenu kwanyidimu yayeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala chalala, nukuyileja nami, muntu wukunkuhwelela, nyidimu yinukukoŋa niyena wakayikoŋa; wakakoŋa niyakubadika iyi, nanichi chinukuya kudi Tata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chonsu chimukulomba mwijina dami nukuchila, kulonda Tata amulemesheli mudi Mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mukulomba chuma mwijina dami nukuchila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwankeŋa, mukuhembaŋa munayilejaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nakamulomba Tata, wakayinka Nkwashi mukwawu akekali nanenu nyaka yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu Spiritu wansaŋu yalala, abulaŋa kutwesha kutambulawu kudi antu ampata yamunu mwishina; muloŋa abulaŋa kumumona, hela kumwiluka hiyamwilukaku; ilaŋa enu mwamwiluka muloŋa washakama nanenu, wakekala mudenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinakayishiya neyi anshonaku; nakenza kudenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunashali kapinji kantesha hohu, antu ampata yamunu mwishina hiyakanmona nawa cheŋuku; ilaŋa enu mwakanmona; chinahandaŋami, dichi chimwakahandaŋa ninenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku odu mwakeluka nenu ami nekala mudi Tata yami, ninenu mwekala mudami ninami mudenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukweti mazu inayilejaŋa nakuyihemba, diyi wankeŋa; ninowu wankeŋa akumukeŋa kudi Tata yami, ninami nukumukeŋa, nukudimwekeshaŋa kudi yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda wacheŋi, hiIsakarotuku, hakumwihula nindi, Eyi Mwanta, ichi chiwukudimwekesha kudetu, wubuli kudi mwekesha kudi antu ampata yamunu mwishina, chikufuma hanka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwakula nindi, Muntu wankeŋa wukuhemba mazu ami; Tata yami wukumukeŋa, ninetu tukwinza kudi yena tukushakama nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wabula kunkeŋa hahembaŋa mazu amuku; nimazu imukutiya hiyamuku, aTata wantemesheli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasambilaŋahu dehi kuyileja mazu awa hohanu nichidi kushakama nanenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Nkwashi, diyi Spiritu Wajila, akatemeshawu kudi Tata mwijina dami, diyi wakayileja yuma yejima, wakayanukisha yinayileji yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwunda nayishiyih; kuwunda kunawundaŋami nayinki. Hinayinki neyi chahanaŋawu antu ampata yamunu mwishinaku. Bayi mwakama munyichima yenuku, bayi mutiya hela womaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munatiyi chinayili nami nukuya kwacheŋi, nakenza kudenu. Neyi mwankeŋa, mutenowu munazaŋalali nanichi chinukuya kudi Tata, muloŋa Tata wambadikami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayilejaŋahu dehi hohanu hichichidi kanda chinzi, kulonda chichakenza mwaketiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
